# E3 CLIO trials

`trial_01/` is a planned E3 workspace (standard directories, `manifest.yaml`, `README.md`; `agent-inputs/` empty). No CLIO
runner, preparation step or trial run exists yet. The CLIO procedure (prompt, permissions, storage access, cache policy and
evidence collection) must be frozen and documented before any counted CLIO trial; it uses the same frozen control packet,
the same permitted collections and the same procedural researcher-only access policy as the baseline
(`setup/E3_PROCEDURAL_ACCESS_UPDATE.md`).

